  <div class="page-label">4DA Merch</div>
  <h1>FAQ</h1>
  <p class="page-intro">Everything you need to know before you order. Still stuck? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a> and a human will answer.</p>

  <h2>Shipping</h2>

  <h3>Where do you ship?</h3>
  <p>Worldwide. Orders are printed on demand at the fulfillment center closest to you, then shipped to your door.</p>

  <h3>How much is shipping?</h3>
  <p>Calculated at checkout based on your location. <strong>Shipping is free on orders over $120 AUD.</strong> All prices on the store are in Australian dollars (AUD).</p>

  <h3>How long does it take?</h3>
  <p>Because every item is made to order, allow <strong>2&ndash;7 business days for production</strong>, then standard carrier transit time on top. Domestic Australian orders typically arrive within 5&ndash;10 business days total; international orders 10&ndash;20 business days depending on destination and customs.</p>

  <h3>Will I be charged customs or duties?</h3>
  <p>International orders may be subject to import duties or taxes set by your country. These are not included in the checkout total and are the responsibility of the recipient.</p>

  <h2>Sizing</h2>

  <h3>What fit are the garments?</h3>
  <p>Unisex classic fit, S through 5XL, on premium Gildan blanks. See the full <a href="/pages/size-chart">size chart</a> for laid-flat measurements in inches and cm.</p>

  <h3>I'm between sizes &mdash; what should I do?</h3>
  <p>Size up for a relaxed fit. The garments are true to the Gildan size chart, so measuring a shirt you already own against our chart is the most reliable guide.</p>

  <h2>Returns &amp; Exchanges</h2>

  <h3>Can I return or exchange an item?</h3>
  <p>Because each piece is printed on demand specifically for your order, we can't accept returns or exchanges for change-of-mind or incorrect size choice. Please use the <a href="/pages/size-chart">size chart</a> before ordering.</p>

  <h3>What if my item arrives damaged or wrong?</h3>
  <p>We stand behind every order. If your item arrives with a print defect, a manufacturing fault, or is the wrong item, <a href="/contact">contact us within 30 days</a> with a photo and we'll reprint or refund it &mdash; no charge, no hassle.</p>

  <h2>Products</h2>

  <h3>How are the designs printed?</h3>
  <p>Designs are applied with a durable direct-to-garment / DTFlex process that sits into the fabric rather than on top of it. It won't crack or peel with normal wear and washing when you follow the <a href="/pages/care-instructions">care instructions</a>.</p>

  <h3>What blanks do you use?</h3>
  <p>Tees are Gildan 5000 heavyweight (5.3 oz, 100% preshrunk cotton). Hoodies are Gildan 18500 and crewnecks are Gildan 18000 (both 8.0 oz Heavy Blend, 50/50 cotton-poly).</p>

  <h3>Is my payment secure?</h3>
  <p>Yes. Checkout is handled by Shopify, which is PCI-DSS compliant, over an encrypted connection. 4DA never sees or stores your card details. See our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> for how order data is handled.</p>

  <h2>Still have a question?</h2>
  <p><a href="/contact">Reach out here</a> &mdash; we read every message.</p>
